            <h3 class="section-heading text-center mb-3">The Largest AI &amp; Software Development Conference on the Prairies!</h3>
			<div class="section-intro text-center single-col-max mx-auto mb-4">Join us this September for the biggest Prairie Dev Con yet! We're expanding to six rooms of sessions over the two days and featuring over 40 world-class speakers
                delivering more than 70 sessions on all things software development and AI. Whether you're a developer, manager, or just passionate about tech, there's something for everyone at PrDC 2026!</div>
            <div class="section-intro text-center single-col-max mx-auto mb-4">Don't miss out on this opportunity to learn, connect, and grow with the Prairie Dev Con community!</div>

