			<div class="row gx-5 py-lg-5">
				<div class="col-12 col-lg-7 h-100">
					<div class="desc">	
						<h4 class="mb-4 mt-3 mt-lg-5">Craig Shyjak, VP of Architecture, Laivly</h4>
							<div>Craig Shyjak is a technology executive and architecture leader focused on the future of software development. With 20+ years of experience and a strong entrepreneurial drive, he has built and led teams delivering scalable platforms across cloud, data, and AI ecosystems.</div>
							<br>
							<div>His recent work explores the rise of agentic AI and its implications for how software is built and consumed. From augmenting developers with AI-driven workflows to designing systems where agents act on behalf of users, Craig focuses on what this shift means for architecture, team structures, and the role of engineers.</div>
							<br>
							<div>He brings a practical, builder-oriented perspective grounded in real-world implementation, with a focus on turning emerging capabilities into production-ready systems.</div>
							<br>

