							<div>
								<iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d10281.501821056592!2d-97.1946334!3d49.8917541!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x399c928436ac7483!2sCanad%20Inns%20Destination%20Centre%20Polo%20Park!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sca!4v1660749183740!5m2!1sen!2sca" width="400" height="300" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
